articles.content_en:
Article 1: The cases of new plant variety disputes accepted by the People's Courts mainly include the following categories:
(1) administrative dispute cases concerning review of rejection of new plant variety applications;
(2) administrative dispute cases concerning invalidation of new plant variety rights;
(3) administrative dispute cases concerning renaming of new plant variety rights;
(4) dispute cases concerning compulsory licensing of new plant variety rights;
(5) dispute cases concerning royalties for compulsory licensing of new plant variety rights;
(6) dispute cases concerning ownership of the right to apply for a new plant variety;
(7) dispute cases concerning ownership of new plant variety rights;
(8) dispute cases concerning contracts for transfer of the right to apply for a new plant variety;
(9) dispute cases concerning contracts for transfer of new plant variety rights;
(10) dispute cases concerning infringement of new plant variety rights;
(11) dispute cases concerning counterfeiting others' new plant variety rights;
(12) dispute cases concerning the right of attribution of breeders of new plant varieties;
(13) dispute cases concerning royalties for use during the period of provisional protection of new plant varieties;
(14) administrative penalty dispute cases concerning new plant varieties;
(15) administrative reconsideration dispute cases concerning new plant varieties;
(16) administrative compensation dispute cases concerning new plant varieties;
(17) administrative reward dispute cases concerning new plant varieties;
(18) other dispute cases concerning new plant variety rights.
